{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kUdsIwsldu1792814541.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一名34歲男子，涉嫌在石硤尾公園的貓糧投放老鼠藥。</p><p></p><p>放在石硤尾公園內的貓糧變成黑色，旁邊有懷疑混入老鼠藥的藍色液體。警方表示凌晨3時許接獲報案，到場後在一名男子身上搜獲一包懷疑老鼠藥，及一把約14厘米長的生果刀。初步調查後，以涉嫌殘酷對待動物以及管有攻擊性武器將他拘捕。案件中沒有貓受傷。</p><p></p><p>報案的動物保護團體表示，由8月中開始，在公園內的貓糧兜發現不明液體，其後發現被捕人形跡可疑，於是報警。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:42.790655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:20.003173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:14.521095+00:00","content_hash":"f643e5f50e3cf65ec51892f4998aaacf94ac3d419f0f85212ab3526c5d37244e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:42.790655+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}